<title>NEW ZEALAND: Prudential NZ trims stakes in LWR, NZ Oil &amp; Gas.</title>
<headline>Prudential NZ trims stakes in LWR, NZ Oil &amp; Gas.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Portfolio Managers NZ said on Monday it had trimmed its stakes in LWR Industries Ltd and New Zealand Oil and Gas Ltd and ceased to be a substantial security holder in either company.</p>
<p>Prudential told the New Zealand Stock Exchange that it now held 4.68 percent of LWR, down from 5.14 percent, and 4.63 percent of NZ Oil and Gas, down from 5.57 percent.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
</text>
